<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>Buster Bar — What's Inside</h2>
<p>While the standard Dilly Bar keeps things simple with plain soft serve and chocolate dip, the Buster Bar takes texture and flavor to a whole new dimension. Once you bite through the snappy chocolate exterior, you immediately hit dense swirls of chocolate fudge and whole roasted peanuts embedded throughout the cold ice cream. It delivers all the nostalgic salty-sweet magic of a sit-down Peanut Buster Parfait, condensed onto a convenient wooden stick. Explore our entire treat catalog on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>Buster Bar vs. Dilly Bar — The Key Difference</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>What's Inside</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Buster Bar® Treat</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>440 cal</td><td>Soft serve + peanuts + fudge + choc shell</td></tr><tr><td>Dilly® Bar (Chocolate)</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td>210 cal</td><td>Plain soft serve + chocolate shell</td></tr><tr><td>Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>220 cal</td><td>Dairy-free base + chocolatey coating</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Does the Buster Bar Contain Peanuts?</h2>
<p>Yes, absolutely. Roasted, salted peanuts are one of the defining star components of the Buster Bar. Because of this, it is strictly unsuitable for anyone suffering from peanut allergies. If you're seeking a safe and delicious nut-free frozen novelty, we recommend opting for a traditional chocolate-dipped Dilly Bar ($1.99) or our plant-based Non-Dairy Dilly Bar ($2.49).</p>
