<p style="margin-top:32px;">For the complete DQ menu with all categories and deals, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The Buster Bar — DQ's Original Frozen Bar</h2>
    <p>Long before the first Blizzard was ever flipped upside down, the Buster Bar was already delighting ice cream lovers across the country. As one of Dairy Queen's foundational novelty creations, it masterfully balances salty roasted peanuts, rich fudge, vanilla cream, and a crunchy candy shell. At $2.49 and 440 calories, it provides tremendous value and substance for anyone craving an on-the-go snack. Browse the rest of our frozen specialties on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Buster Bar vs. Dilly Bar — Which to Choose?</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th></th><th>Buster Bar</th><th>Dilly Bar (Chocolate)</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Price</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Calories</td><td>440 cal</td><td>210 cal</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Contents</td><td>Soft serve + peanuts + fudge + chocolate shell</td><td>Soft serve + chocolate shell only</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Flavor</td><td>Rich, salty-sweet, multi-layered</td><td>Clean, simple, classic</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Best For</td><td>Guests who want more complexity and substance</td><td>Guests who want a simple, light novelty bar</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>What's in the Buster Bar</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>DQ vanilla soft serve core</strong> — The same base used across all DQ frozen treats</li>
      <li><strong>Salted peanuts</strong> — Distributed throughout the soft serve for crunch and salt</li>
      <li><strong>Fudge layer</strong> — Chocolate fudge threaded through the soft serve</li>
      <li><strong>Chocolate shell coating</strong> — Hardens on contact with the cold soft serve, shatters on the first bite</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The Salty-Sweet Formula</h2>
    <p>At its heart, the Buster Bar leverages the exact same beloved flavor blueprint that turned the <a href="/items/peanut-buster-parfait">Peanut Buster Parfait</a> into an American legend: salted peanuts and velvety fudge colliding with sweet vanilla soft serve. The key distinction is pure portability. While the Parfait requires a spoon and a seat, the Buster Bar is completely handheld and costs $2.50 less, making it a wonderful grab-and-go indulgence.</p>

    <h2>Best for Peanut Lovers</h2>
    <p>If your all-time favorites include the <a href="/items/reeses-blizzard">Reese's Blizzard</a> or the Peanut Buster Parfait, you will feel right at home here. The Buster Bar celebrates that same legendary trifecta of peanut butter crunch, deep cocoa, and cool cream—packaged into the single most affordable and portable frozen bar on the menu.</p>

